description=Ultimate hardware loudspeaker & earpiece acoustic volume booster for Realme Narzo 30A (RMX3171). Uncaps analog line-out to +8dB, unlocks positive digital curves, injects ringtone-level DRC makeup gain, and expands WideSound filtering. Remove to return to stock audio.
